说明 / Notes
------------

- 规范名称是 CC BY-NC-SA 4.0。上游 README 写作「BY-SA-NC」，指的是同一个许可证。
  The canonical name is CC BY-NC-SA 4.0; upstream writes it "BY-SA-NC" — same licence.

- 文档中引用的上游源码片段（注释、常量、寄存器定义）来自
  pollen-robotics/microduck，遵循其 Apache-2.0 许可证，引用处均标注了文件路径。
  Source excerpts quoted in the documentation come from pollen-robotics/microduck
  under Apache-2.0, with file paths cited at each quotation.

- 非商业性使用：CC BY-NC-SA 禁止商业用途。本仓库仅供学习、研究与个人复刻。
  Non-commercial: CC BY-NC-SA forbids commercial use. This repository is for
  study, research and personal replication only.

